! final.md — research, 2026-11-08

Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/survive-research/c-b/final.md` (research, file date 2026-11-08); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/survive-research/c-b/index]].

